WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,190 --> 00:00:09,010
Teacher Xiang has nothing to do

2
00:00:09,330 --> 00:00:17,540
He only has hot water and no medicine, right?

3
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,930
I really want to beg him, Sister Weiwei

4
00:00:21,250 --> 00:00:22,850
How about letting him come and take a look?

5
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:25,050
Everyone is so embarrassed

6
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:31,770
How much is face worth? No need to talk about it.

7
00:00:32,210 --> 00:00:33,650
People with fever cannot survive the second bowl

8
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:37,090
There was fire, clean water, and food there but not here.

9
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:45,570
Shen Yao can’t wait for you to order the incense yourself.

10
00:00:49,890 --> 00:00:50,890
One year of filming

11
00:00:51,530 --> 00:00:53,090
The crew was trapped in the mountains for seven days

12
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:55,660
Someone in the clan has a high fever

13
00:00:56,710 --> 00:00:58,430
The director wrote this article in front of the entire team

14
00:00:59,030 --> 00:01:00,350
Kneeling ball comes to the rescue

15
00:01:01,050 --> 00:01:02,330
The day people carried them down the mountain

16
00:01:02,690 --> 00:01:03,930
No one laughed at him

17
00:01:05,940 --> 00:01:09,420
It’s not shameful to ask for help and wait.

18
00:01:10,140 --> 00:01:12,100
Maybe I can get through it by myself.
